    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p><strong>Statement I:</strong> Chlorine can easily combine with oxygen to from oxides: and the product has a tendency to explode.</p><p><strong>Statement II:</strong> Chemical reactivity of an element can be determined by its reaction with oxygen and halogens.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
